{"sourceUrl":"https://eie.scu.edu.cn/info/1025/15213.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:51.071754+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://eie.scu.edu.cn/info/1025/15213.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><strong><span>四川大学电子信息学院</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>关于举办</span></strong><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span></strong><strong><span>的通知</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong> </strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>为了促进全国各高校信息与通信工程学科、光学工程学科、电子科学与技术学科</span></strong><strong><span>、电子信息专业学位</span></strong><strong><span>优秀大学生的互动与交流，培养大学生从事科学研究的兴趣，并为优秀本科生提供了解我院学术科研环境</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>与专家学者</span></strong><strong><span>深入</span></strong><strong><span>交流的机会。我院</span></strong><strong><span>暂定</span></strong><strong><span><span>于</span>202</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>年</span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>3</span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>在线上举办</span><span>“202</span></span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span><span>年电子信息学院优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></span></strong><strong><span>夏令营期间将进行</span></strong><strong><span>学院宣传及学科介绍等</span></strong><strong><span>活动</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>现面向全国高校招收</span></strong><strong><span>线上</span></strong><strong><span>营</span></strong><strong><span>员，相关安排及注意事项公告如下：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>一、</span></strong><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>1<span>、全国各高校信息与通信工程学科、光学工程学科、电子科学与技术学科</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、电子信息专业学位</span><span>(</span><span>新一代电子信息技术、光电信息工程、通信工程、人工智能</span></span></strong><strong><span>)<span>的三年级本科生（</span><span>202</span></span></strong><strong><span>7</span></strong><strong><span>届毕业生）；</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span><span>2</span><span>、本科期间品学兼优，无违纪记录；</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span><span>3</span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>对从事信息与通信工程学科</span>/<span>光学工程学科</span><span>/</span><span>电子科学与技术学科</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>/</span><span>电子信息专业学位</span></span></strong><strong><span>的学术研究具有浓厚兴趣，具有一定创新能力和潜能</span></strong><strong><span>，</span></strong><strong><span>热爱科研，对专业有浓厚兴趣，有扎实的基础理论知识和良好的动手实验、实践能力</span></strong><strong><span>；</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>4<span>、英语达到国家四</span><span>/</span><span>六级水平（</span><span>425</span><span>分以上）或</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>GRE</span><span>、</span><span>IELTS</span><span>等考试成绩</span></span></strong><strong><span>较好</span></strong><strong><span>者。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>二、申请材料</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>1<span>、申请表</span></span></strong><strong><span>（报名成功后由系统自动生成，下载后经所在单位推荐盖章后再上传至系统</span></strong><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>2<span>、本科成绩单和专业排名证明（各</span><span>1</span><span>份</span></span></strong><strong><span>，</span></strong><strong><span>需加盖所在学校教务处公章）；</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>3<span>、相关获奖证书复印件、学术成果复印件等。</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>三、申请办法及时间</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>1<span>、报名方法：申请人登录四川大学研究生招生信息网夏令营网报平台（</span><span>https://yz.scu.edu.cn/xly</span><span>）进行报名，并将申请表、本科成绩单、专业排名证明、相关获奖证书复印件、学术成果复印件等，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>签字盖章后彩色扫描，扫描后的文件按顺序合并成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，</span></span></strong></span><a href=\"mailto:%E5%8F%91%E8%87%B3%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B11294541001@qq.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><strong><span>以附件形式上传至网报平台</span></strong></span></a><span><strong><span>。</span></strong><strong><span>第一次报名成功之后生成申请表，然后再</span></strong><strong><span>点击“上传（更新）附件”</span></strong><strong><span>就可以重新提交包含申请表的附件了</span></strong><strong><span>；</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>2<span>、报名时间：自即日起开始报名，截止日</span></span></strong><strong><span>期为</span></strong><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span>6<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span>30</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>12</span></strong><strong><span>: 00</span></strong><strong><span>，过期不再接受申请</span></strong><strong><span>；</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>3<span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span>本次线上会议使用腾讯会议</span></strong><strong><span>，</span></strong><strong><span>具体</span></strong><strong><span>会议号</span></strong><strong><span>和开营时间</span></strong><strong><span>以系统报名须知为准</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span>、注意事项</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>1<span>、申请者应保证所提交的所有电子信息及材料的真实性、有效性、完整性</span></span></strong><strong><span>，若在任何阶段发现申请材料不真实、不准确，或有弄虚作假、违纪作弊等行为的，经查证，即取消申请人一切资格，一切后果自负</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>2<span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span>在营期间，营员必须遵守四川大学的相关规定。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>3</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span><span>所有营员请以“所在高校</span><span>+</span><span>姓名”实名加入腾讯会议，禁止发表不当言论，</span></span></strong><strong><span>禁止录音录像。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>、联系方式</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>联系人：</span></strong><strong><span>赖</span></strong><strong><span>老师</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span><span>联系电话：</span>02885463874</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>四川大学电子信息学院</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>年</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>8</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"483115dc1e89126e1b855178d6a4995c1d821832df692e3ce477e0f817a2b098","textLength":1080,"sourceSha256":"787416556f2b5bdf1a232f6f1262d27b0b57f7546389c334a287ecd49d7559fe","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-98c3d38f1ab84344b431","title":"2026年四川大学电子信息学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:51.071754+00:00"}
